[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0389","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0389.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0442","title":"Google Chrome Payments 界面欺骗漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 132.0.6834.83 之前版本中的 Payments 组件存在不当实现漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面并诱骗用户执行特定的 UI 手势（如点击或拖拽操作），成功利用该漏洞可导致 UI 界面欺骗（UI Spoofing），使用户误认为正在与合法界面交互，从而在不知情的情况下授权恶意操作。该漏洞仅影响用户界面完整性（CVSS 完整性影响为高），攻击需用户交互，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。Google 已在 Chrome 132.0.6834.83 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0442"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-15T11:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:26:29Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 132.0.6834.83 或更高版本（Chromium 用户同步更新至对应版本），该版本已修复 Payments 模块中的不当实现导致的 UI 欺骗漏洞。无法立即升级时，可配置浏览器策略禁用第三方支付请求或提醒用户谨慎交互，降低被诱导风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/01/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_14.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40940854","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2025/CVE-2025-0442.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0442.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0442.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-0442","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-0442.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2025/01/GHSA-g76w-p5m2-4jvf/GHSA-g76w-p5m2-4jvf.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-0442","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-0442.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d